    "description": "PLAY isolated (no arbiter, no klino/planner) on the L-bend maze -- the discovery/coverage test: does frontier-wander traverse the wall and cover the maze? ISOLATION WIN: 2.5x maze discovery, +48% crossings. But this FALSIFIED 'discovery is the eats lever': in composition better discovery did NOT move eats, and the powered ablation shows play is a net eats-COST where exploitation is available. LIVE: slide play frontier_bias. Results: docs/reports/cell_markov_blanket_loops_report.md",
